{
    "title": "Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper",
    "description": "Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper - A scary adventure awaits! The first mobile version of Anomaly Zoo game.\r\n\r\nIn this chasing game, you are a smiling critters impostor trapped in an anomaly filled zoo. There are haunted evil anomaly monsters everywhere, and you have to run, survive and complete all missions to escape this scary zoo \ud83c\udfc3\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f BE THE LAST SMILING CRITTERS SURVIVOR IN THE ANOMALY CHASE \u2694\ufe0f \r\n- There are 6 MODES for you to play, including a special challenge that rewards you greatly with gold \ud83d\udcb0\r\n- Use the joysticks to move around and survive while escaping the anomaly's grip \ud83d\udd0d\r\n- Always remember to finish the missions within the countdown playtime in the zoo \u23f1\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\u2b50 MEET THE ANOMALY MONSTERS \u2b50\r\nA cursed was casted on the Puppy Playtime buddies, turning them into blood-thirsty monsters in the Anomaly Zoo. While investigating the cause of the monster infestation in the zoo, you are trapped among the smiling monsters with unforeseeable jumpscares! They are the zoo keeper.\r\nAvoid contact at all costs. When in doubt, RUN to survive!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd34 Creepy Keeper of the Zoo: \r\nHe will seek you out with his laser eyes, chase you with ground shaking stomps. Avoid contact with Zoo keeper at all costs, or you will be ended by his sharp teeth.\r\n\ud83d\udfe3 Cat Sleep Horror: Once you are unlucky enough to end up in her grip, you will be put to sleep forever. Beware of the living nightmare!\r\n\ud83d\udd35 Scary Puppy: Stay out of his big arms, or puppy playtime is over! He is creepiest anomaly and will chase you down until you are out of breath.\r\n\r\n\u2757 Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper - TIPS\r\n\ud83d\udd08 Pay close attention to the sound in the game, you don\u2019t want to be caught in your playtime.\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Anomaly can be detected by sound! It's best to wear a headphone while playing to help the smiling critters impostor escape from the creepy zoo!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 EXCLUSIVE FEATURE \ud83d\udd25\r\n- Outstanding 2D graphic design.\r\n- Dynamic anomaly fight game with a unique combination.\r\n- Famous characters with most awesome impostor outfits ever.\r\n- Fun and addictive dynamic gameplay.\r\n- Best simple running adventure game ever.\r\n\r\nEmbark on a scary yet adventurous journey to survive as an impostor with Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper. Enjoy the spine-chilling horror zoo escape while facing the haunted version of the smiling monsters.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on the mobile version of Anomaly Zoo game. Download now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper - A scary adventure awaits! The first mobile version of Anomaly Zoo game.<br><br>In this chasing game, you are a smiling critters impostor trapped in an anomaly filled zoo. There are haunted evil anomaly monsters everywhere, and you have to run, survive and complete all missions to escape this scary zoo \ud83c\udfc3<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f BE THE LAST SMILING CRITTERS SURVIVOR IN THE ANOMALY CHASE \u2694\ufe0f <br>- There are 6 MODES for you to play, including a special challenge that rewards you greatly with gold \ud83d\udcb0<br>- Use the joysticks to move around and survive while escaping the anomaly&#39;s grip \ud83d\udd0d<br>- Always remember to finish the missions within the countdown playtime in the zoo \u23f1\ufe0f<br><br>\u2b50 MEET THE ANOMALY MONSTERS \u2b50<br>A cursed was casted on the Puppy Playtime buddies, turning them into blood-thirsty monsters in the Anomaly Zoo. While investigating the cause of the monster infestation in the zoo, you are trapped among the smiling monsters with unforeseeable jumpscares! They are the zoo keeper.<br>Avoid contact at all costs. When in doubt, RUN to survive!<br><br>\ud83d\udd34 Creepy Keeper of the Zoo: <br>He will seek you out with his laser eyes, chase you with ground shaking stomps. Avoid contact with Zoo keeper at all costs, or you will be ended by his sharp teeth.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Cat Sleep Horror: Once you are unlucky enough to end up in her grip, you will be put to sleep forever. Beware of the living nightmare!<br>\ud83d\udd35 Scary Puppy: Stay out of his big arms, or puppy playtime is over! He is creepiest anomaly and will chase you down until you are out of breath.<br><br>\u2757 Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper - TIPS<br>\ud83d\udd08 Pay close attention to the sound in the game, you don\u2019t want to be caught in your playtime.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Anomaly can be detected by sound! It&#39;s best to wear a headphone while playing to help the smiling critters impostor escape from the creepy zoo!<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 EXCLUSIVE FEATURE \ud83d\udd25<br>- Outstanding 2D graphic design.<br>- Dynamic anomaly fight game with a unique combination.<br>- Famous characters with most awesome impostor outfits ever.<br>- Fun and addictive dynamic gameplay.<br>- Best simple running adventure game ever.<br><br>Embark on a scary yet adventurous journey to survive as an impostor with Zoo Critters: Monster Keeper. Enjoy the spine-chilling horror zoo escape while facing the haunted version of the smiling monsters.<br><br>Don&#39;t miss out on the mobile version of Anomaly Zoo game. Download now!",
